# 04-bots.mdc

Bot-system guidance.

- Bots are admin-triggered only; never start bot loops implicitly on import or app startup.
- Each market uses a hardcoded hidden `p_true` for deterministic demo convergence.
- Bot strategy samples a private belief around `p_true`, compares it to CPMM price, and buys YES or NO by conviction.
- Keep live cadence controlled, roughly every 1-3 seconds.
- Keep bot behavior deterministic when running scripted sequences.
- Separate strategy logic from orchestration/runtime concerns.
- Log bot decisions with enough metadata for post-trade analysis.
- Enforce risk limits and market validity checks before any bot trade.
- Avoid hidden side effects in strategy evaluation functions.
